{"title":"“What are they likely to do?”","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/pkz252","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/level-03","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardNATENG","voiceLang":"en","voice":"m2_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f3_2025","speaker":true},"trainers":[{"trainer":"dragGroup","instruction":{"text":"Which actions match which personalities? Drag and sort."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleAtoms":true,"cats":[{"sound":"hard-working","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/lsg/03/labeled-hardworking.lsg"},{"sound":"kind","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/lsg/03/labeled-kind.lsg"},{"sound":"neat","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/lsg/03/labeled-neat.lsg"}],"atoms":[{"cat":0,"b":"trying your best in everything you do"},{"cat":1,"b":"feeding stray dogs"},{"cat":2,"b":"washing the dishes after every meal"},{"cat":0,"b":"showing up for football training every time"},{"cat":1,"b":"helping an old person cross the road"},{"cat":2,"b":"folding clothes after washing them"}]},{"trainer":"dragGroup","instruction":{"text":"Which actions match which personalities? Drag and sort."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleAtoms":true,"cats":[{"sound":"gloomy","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/lsg/03/labeled-gloomy.lsg"},{"sound":"rude","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/lsg/03/labeled-rude.lsg"},{"sound":"cheerful","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/lsg/03/labeled-cheerful.lsg"}],"atoms":[{"cat":0,"b":"lying in bed all day"},{"cat":1,"b":"screaming at waiters in restaurants"},{"cat":2,"b":"telling lots of jokes"},{"cat":0,"b":"crying often"},{"cat":1,"b":"calling your classmates bad names"},{"cat":2,"b":"laughing a lot"}]},{"trainer":"dragGroup","instruction":{"text":"Which actions match which personalities? Drag and sort."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleAtoms":true,"cats":[{"sound":"quiet","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/lsg/03/labeled-quiet.lsg"},{"sound":"loud","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/lsg/03/labeled-loud.lsg"},{"sound":"lazy","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/lsg/03/labeled-lazy.lsg"}],"atoms":[{"cat":0,"b":"not saying anything at parties"},{"cat":1,"b":"singing confidently at parties"},{"cat":2,"b":"skipping netball practice"},{"cat":0,"b":"reading a book alone in the corner"},{"cat":1,"b":"making a lot of noise in lessons"},{"cat":2,"b":"always being late for work"}]},{"trainer":"multipleChoice","instruction":{"text":"Choose <b>all</b> the sentences that are likely to be true."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleButtons":true,"shuffleAtoms":true,"atoms":[{"a":"I am a hard-working person.","voice":"f7_chirp","b":["++She gets to work early.","++She finishes her work on time.","She forgets to do her chores.","She smiles a lot."],"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/maja.lsg"},{"a":"I am a cheerful person.","voice":"m8_chirp","b":["++He smiles a lot.","++He makes people around him happy.","++He doesn’t get upset often.","He keeps his desk clean and organised."],"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/francesco.lsg"},{"a":"I am a quiet person.","voice":"f2_chirp","b":["She talks a lot.","++She doesn’t make a lot of noise.","She never skips school.","++She doesn’t raise her hand in lessons."],"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"},{"a":"I am a messy person.","voice":"f3_chirp","b":["++She leaves her things all over the floor in her room.","She goes for a jog often.","She cleans her room every day.","She doesn’t hand in her homework on time."],"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/noor.lsg"}]},{"trainer":"gap","gapMode":"write","instruction":{"text":"What kind of person are they? Listen and write."},"textAlign":"left","shuffleAtoms":true,"soundMode":"askSound","atoms":[{"a":"I don’t study for my exams. It’s just too much hard work. I know I should, because that’s my responsibility. I want to too, but I just prefer to relax and take things easy. Why stress myself out so much, you know?","b":"Rhys is a ((lazy)) person.","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/rhys.lsg","voice":"m14_chirp"},{"a":"Sometimes, I think my life is so boring. I don’t really like doing things. I don’t see the point. People tell me I should smile more, but that would be lying.","b":"Ana is a ((gloomy)) person.","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg","voice":"f5_chirp"},{"a":"I think people are just stupid a lot of the time. Why can’t they just stop doing so many stupid things? When I tell them that, they get upset, but that’s silly. I’m just saying the truth.","b":"Denys is a ((rude)) person.","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/denys.lsg","voice":"m4_chirp"},{"a":"I just get excited all the time and sometimes I scream or shout because I’m too excited. I’m not trying to be rude. I just can’t help myself. The quiet people don’t like me. They think I’m too noisy.","b":"Niamh is a ((loud)) person.","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/niamh.lsg","voice":"f2Us_chirp"}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Body and Health","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/topic","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/ocmj0z"},"parentBlock":{"title":"My Personality","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-09-body-and-health/block-02-my-personality/block","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/8eqc4z"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/en/f2Us_chirp/I just get excited all the time and sometimes I scream or shout because I’m too excited. I’m not trying to be rude. I just can’t help myself. The quiet people don’t like me. They think I’m too noisy.","etag":"2bc0-45096"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2_chirp/I am a quiet person.","etag":"45df-6501"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/Choose <b>all</b> the sentences that are likely to be true.","etag":"144b-17468"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/What kind of person are they? Listen and write.","etag":"317f-17756"},{"fileId":"soun